  "elements": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "title",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 30,
      "width": 1140,
      "height": 70,
      "text": "Case Study 48: 85-Day C-Suite Solution Roadmap",
      "fontSize": 30,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "subtitle",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 92,
      "width": 1140,
      "height": 45,
      "text": "11 delivery sessions finish 5 Dec | 6-13 Dec reserved for finishing margin and presentation",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "id": "s1",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 170,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 250,
      "strokeColor": "#0078D4",
      "backgroundColor": "#CFE4FA",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roundness": { "type": 3 },
      "boundElements": [{ "type": "text", "id": "s1t" }]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "s1t",
      "containerId": "s1",
      "x": 78,
      "y": 188,
      "width": 314,
      "height": 210,
      "text": "SESSION 1 | 20-26 SEP\nLock the engagement contract\n\n• Decision and audience\n• 10-minute promise + non-goals\n• Evidence labels and source register\n• 11 delivery days + margin week\n\nPASS: ask fits one sentence",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle"
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "id": "s2",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 170,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 250,
      "strokeColor": "#0078D4",
      "backgroundColor": "#CFE4FA",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roundness": { "type": 3 },
      "boundElements": [{ "type": "text", "id": "s2t" }]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "s2t",
      "containerId": "s2",
      "x": 488,
      "y": 188,
      "width": 314,
      "height": 210,
      "text": "SESSION 2 | 27 SEP-3 OCT\nEstablish traceability\n\n• Requirement + claim matrix\n• Dated rule-source register\n• Assumptions and risk register\n• MEES, Awaab, PAS 2035, UK GDPR\n\nPASS: no unsupported core claim",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle"
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "id": "s3",
      "x": 880,
      "y": 170,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 250,
      "strokeColor": "#5C2D91",
      "backgroundColor": "#E8DAEF",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roundness": { "type": 3 },
      "boundElements": [{ "type": "text", "id": "s3t" }]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "s3t",
      "containerId": "s3",
      "x": 898,
      "y": 188,
      "width": 314,
      "height": 210,
      "text": "SESSION 3 | 4-10 OCT\nInvestigate operations + safety\n\n• Four fictional role interviews\n• Resident/property journey\n• 15-stage lifecycle\n• Authority + stop-control matrix\n\nGATE A: reset if problem/ask is unclear",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle"
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "id": "s4",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 480,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 250,
      "strokeColor": "#5C2D91",
      "backgroundColor": "#E8DAEF",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roundness": { "type": 3 },
      "boundElements": [{ "type": "text", "id": "s4t" }]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "s4t",
      "containerId": "s4",
      "x": 78,
      "y": 498,
      "width": 314,
      "height": 210,
      "text": "SESSION 4 | 11-17 OCT\nTest value + acceptance\n\n• Four more role interviews\n• Compare process, BI, bounded AI, five agents\n• Synthetic-data specification\n• Benefits/evaluation scorecard\n\nPASS: a non-agent option survives",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle"
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "id": "s5",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 480,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 250,
      "strokeColor": "#5C2D91",
      "backgroundColor": "#E8DAEF",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roundness": { "type": 3 },
      "boundElements": [{ "type": "text", "id": "s5t" }]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "s5t",
      "containerId": "s5",
      "x": 488,
      "y": 498,
      "width": 314,
      "height": 210,
      "text": "SESSION 5 | 18-24 OCT\nChoose the proposition\n\n• High-level architecture\n• Target operating model\n• Architecture decisions\n• Executive options + recommendation\n\nGATE B: kill five-agent-first",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle"
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "id": "s6",
      "x": 880,
      "y": 480,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 250,
      "strokeColor": "#F7630C",
      "backgroundColor": "#FFF4CE",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 3,
      "roundness": { "type": 3 },
      "boundElements": [{ "type": "text", "id": "s6t" }]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "s6t",
      "containerId": "s6",
      "x": 898,
      "y": 498,
      "width": 314,
      "height": 210,
      "text": "SESSION 6 | 25-31 OCT\nPROTECTED RECOVERY\n\nMentor + architecture + sector + privacy review\n\nAccept | Repair | Restart | Stop\n\nNo medium-level work from rejected design",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle"
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "id": "s7",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 790,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 250,
      "strokeColor": "#0C8599",
      "backgroundColor": "#99E9F2",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roundness": { "type": 3 },
      "boundElements": [{ "type": "text", "id": "s7t" }]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "s7t",
      "containerId": "s7",
      "x": 78,
      "y": 808,
      "width": 314,
      "height": 210,
      "text": "SESSION 7 | 1-7 NOV\nMedium-level architecture\n\n• Components + responsibilities\n• Data and event flow\n• Trust boundaries\n• Failure, fallback, disable, replay\n\nPASS: AI has no irreversible action",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle"
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "id": "s8",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 790,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 250,
      "strokeColor": "#0C8599",
      "backgroundColor": "#99E9F2",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roundness": { "type": 3 },
      "boundElements": [{ "type": "text", "id": "s8t" }]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "s8t",
      "containerId": "s8",
      "x": 488,
      "y": 808,
      "width": 314,
      "height": 210,
      "text": "SESSION 8 | 8-14 NOV\nSynthetic evidence + demo gate\n\n• ~500 properties / 12 months\n• Manifest, dictionary, ground truth\n• Deterministic validation\n• Mentor accepts/rejects specification\n\nGATE C: demo must add decision evidence",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle"
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "id": "s9",
      "x": 880,
      "y": 790,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 250,
      "strokeColor": "#0C8599",
      "backgroundColor": "#99E9F2",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 3,
      "roundness": { "type": 3 },
      "boundElements": [{ "type": "text", "id": "s9t" }]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "s9t",
      "containerId": "s9",
      "x": 898,
      "y": 808,
      "width": 314,
      "height": 210,
      "text": "SESSION 9 | 15-21 NOV\nBuild or rebuild narrow slice\n\n• Timeline + constraint queue\n• Safety control + bounded AI summary\n• Clean reset + failure narration\n• At midpoint failure, switch to fallback\n\nFull prototype discard is allowed here",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle"
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "id": "s10",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 1100,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 250,
      "strokeColor": "#107C10",
      "backgroundColor": "#DFF6DD",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roundness": { "type": 3 },
      "boundElements": [{ "type": "text", "id": "s10t" }]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "s10t",
      "containerId": "s10",
      "x": 78,
      "y": 1118,
      "width": 314,
      "height": 210,
      "text": "SESSION 10 | 22-28 NOV\nIntegrate and test the story\n\n• Integrate slide-ready modules from Sessions 1-9\n• Executive-proxy 10-minute test\n• One bounded opening rewrite if needed\n• Notes, appendix and full reconciliation\n\nGATE D: simplify if recall still fails",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle"
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "id": "s11",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 1100,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 250,
      "strokeColor": "#F7630C",
      "backgroundColor": "#FFF4CE",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 3,
      "roundness": { "type": 3 },
      "boundElements": [{ "type": "text", "id": "s11t" }]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "s11t",
      "containerId": "s11",
      "x": 488,
      "y": 1118,
      "width": 314,
      "height": 210,
      "text": "SESSION 11 | 29 NOV-5 DEC\nFINAL READINESS + FREEZE\n\n• Post-30 Nov regulatory delta check only\n• Reconcile resulting changes\n• One timed rehearsal\n• Verify accepted demo + fallback once\n\nGATE E: enter margin presentation-ready",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle"
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "id": "s12",
      "x": 880,
      "y": 1100,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 250,
      "strokeColor": "#1E1E1E",
      "backgroundColor": "#F3F2F1",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 3,
      "roundness": { "type": 3 },
      "boundElements": [{ "type": "text", "id": "s12t" }]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "s12t",
      "containerId": "s12",
      "x": 898,
      "y": 1118,
      "width": 314,
      "height": 210,
      "text": "MARGIN WEEK | 6-13 DEC\nFinish details and present\n\n• Minor corrections + accessibility\n• Package and back up all artifacts\n• One confidence rehearsal; no new scope\n• Present and record decision + owners\n\nMARGIN: core package passed by 5 Dec",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "runshow",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 1410,
      "width": 1170,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "FINAL HOUR\n0-10 Win the room | 10-18 Evidence | 18-28 Future state + HLA | 28-38 MLA + trade-offs\n38-44 Demo/fallback | 44-50 Value | 50-54 Ask | 54-60 Challenge + decision\n\nDefault ask: approve capped readiness and shadow-pilot design, not live deployment.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
